1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,038
This is PolyglotFormFill.

2
00:00:01,088 --> 00:00:06,838
Let me show you, plainly, what it does — and why it might matter to you.

3
00:00:06,288 --> 00:00:12,122
Maybe you fill the same forms again and again — for a job, a lease, a benefit you are owed.

4
00:00:12,172 --> 00:00:15,358
Maybe a form arrives in a language you are still learning.

5
00:00:15,408 --> 00:00:19,477
Or maybe you are the one in the family everyone brings their paperwork to.

6
00:00:19,527 --> 00:00:23,302
If any of that is you, this was built with you in mind.

7
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:26,496
Think of everything you type into forms, over and over.

8
00:00:26,546 --> 00:00:34,462
Your name and address, yes — but also your passport number, a tax ID, an employer, a bank account, an allergy.

9
00:00:34,512 --> 00:00:44,326
Save any detail once, and PolyglotFormFill fills it into every form that asks for it — as many times as you need, wherever you need it.

10
00:00:43,776 --> 00:00:46,926


11
00:00:46,376 --> 00:00:48,976
You do not even have to type them.

12
00:00:49,026 --> 00:00:50,301
Photograph your driver's licence.

13
00:00:50,351 --> 00:00:57,257
The front is read here on your device — name, date of birth, licence number — straight into your encrypted vault.

14
00:00:57,307 --> 00:01:03,220
The barcode on the back carries that same data exactly, and it is read on your device too.

15
00:01:03,270 --> 00:01:05,208
A passport works the same way.

16
00:01:05,258 --> 00:01:11,170
And it is not only the text: the licence and passport pictures themselves are saved with your profile.

17
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:14,814
Nothing is uploaded — the reading happens right here, with you.

18
00:01:14,264 --> 00:01:19,834
Even a flat scan — a page with no boxes to click into — is understood.

19
00:01:19,884 --> 00:01:25,806
It finds where each answer belongs and makes the page fillable, with no printer and no scanner.

20
00:01:25,256 --> 00:01:36,248
Then the form fills itself — not just the name and address, but the licence number, the tax ID, the employer, the bank details, whatever this particular form happens to ask for.

21
00:01:36,298 --> 00:01:37,628
You look it over.

22
00:01:37,678 --> 00:01:40,734
You are always in control of what goes in.

23
00:01:40,184 --> 00:01:41,457
Not only the typing.

24
00:01:41,507 --> 00:01:49,062
The choices too — a drop-down, a set of options, a box to tick — answered from what you told it just once.

25
00:01:48,512 --> 00:01:51,004
A photo where the form wants a photo.

26
00:01:51,054 --> 00:01:53,546
Your signature on the line meant for it.

27
00:01:53,596 --> 00:01:56,406
Placed for you, not cut and pasted by hand.

28
00:01:55,856 --> 00:01:59,521
And when a form asks something new, you answer it once.

29
00:01:59,571 --> 00:02:05,262
It is kept — privately, on your device — so the next form that asks already knows.

30
00:02:04,712 --> 00:02:06,057
Your details are yours.

31
00:02:06,107 --> 00:02:09,195
But you are rarely filling only your own forms.

32
00:02:09,245 --> 00:02:17,214
Keep a profile for each person you help — a partner, a parent, a child — and their forms fill just as easily.

33
00:02:16,664 --> 00:02:19,814


34
00:02:19,264 --> 00:02:21,489
It is the same at work.

35
00:02:21,539 --> 00:02:30,590
A profile for each recurring form — a vendor record, an expense claim — each holding exactly the right details, filled correctly every time.

36
00:02:30,040 --> 00:02:33,190


37
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:34,606
And it is not only PDFs.

38
00:02:34,656 --> 00:02:42,334
Add the browser companion, and the forms you meet online fill the same way — from the same details, with a single click.

39
00:02:41,784 --> 00:02:43,440
And language is never the barrier.

40
00:02:43,490 --> 00:02:46,853
Use the whole app in your own language — any of them.

41
00:02:46,903 --> 00:02:51,118
A form in a language you do not read is shown to you in yours.

42
00:02:51,168 --> 00:02:57,374
And you can fill it in whichever language you choose — what you type is written back in the form’s own language.

43
00:02:57,424 --> 00:03:00,502
Read in yours, write in theirs, or the other way around.

44
00:02:59,952 --> 00:03:02,438
One thing matters more than all the rest.

45
00:03:02,488 --> 00:03:07,192
Every bit of this happens on your device — the reading, the filling, the signing.

46
00:03:07,242 --> 00:03:10,678
We never see your forms, and we never see your data.

47
00:03:10,128 --> 00:03:12,616
That is the whole of it — no catch.

48
00:03:12,666 --> 00:03:19,102
If it would make your life a little easier, it is free while we are in beta, at polyglot form fill dot com.
